# XSH if_freenameindex()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.if_freenameindex.001
anchor     functions/if_freenameindex.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      2024
says       if_freenameindex() of an array returned by if_nameindex() leaves errno as it was.
test       t/001-errno-kept.c

assertion  XSH.if_freenameindex.002
anchor     functions/if_freenameindex.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      2001
says       With two arrays returned by if_nameindex(), freeing one leaves the other with the same first entry.
note       NOTINUSE when no interface exists.
test       t/002-lists-independent.c
